{"version":1,"content":"<p>《愛．回家之開心速遞》雖然已於今年8月曲終人散，不過，劇中一班演員關係要好，尤其是「熊家人」果然如之前所承諾，不時相約出來聚會。</p><p>繼「熊家人」早前為呂慧儀及古佩玲慶生後，近日他們再次出動，「大家姐」滕麗名與「二妹」呂慧儀昨日（7日）在社交網分</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.629688+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T10:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"1e6e48155aab49a05f28aa46e31d2ab097968754a6d7f05ca6838186cc782b89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}